    "Acceptance exercises actual public start/stop/peersJson and production listener objects on the JVM at inert Mockito NSD boundaries. It does not execute Android NSD, Binder, a provider or a real network.",
    "No native NSD fixture is admitted: supported start obtains a live final Android NsdManager and immediately registers/discovers. No private-field injection, null manager, copied listener model, keep rule or platform workaround is used.",
    "Native callback scheduling, Android API28/29 discovery, optimized candidate callback runtime, authenticated /remote/devices execution, phone pairing and physical multi-room discovery remain unverified. Exact optimized package delivery establishes installation and bytes only.",
    "A Found callback admitted before retirement may issue its external resolve request after stop; its result cannot publish after ownership is retired. No platform cancellation or universal callback ordering claim is made.",
    "Baseline optimized structural inspection retains rewritten start and concrete callbacks; it does not imply candidate optimized runtime acceptance or that all callback methods were removed.",
    "Family visual review covers the current frame only. Living visual acceptance and discovery UI acceptance remain open. Limited lines=1500 diagnostics do not establish complete runtime health.",
    "The original 13:09:28–13:39:28 UTC clock includes inventory, tests, delivery and documentation. Prayer tomorrow, NotificationOverlay, artwork, Snapcast and every older held or exhausted scope retain their original clocks.",
    "Public manifest remains1.83/code77. Existing phone-control, publication, HA and design-approval restrictions remain."
